    ao-sales + ao-reporting-egress non-internal by decision

Correction to an earlier concern of mine: I had said an internal network
could never be reached by a viewer. That was wrong for a LOOPBACK publish.
Measured precedent: `ao-mapping` is internal=true and `ao-webodm-web`
